  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "transport",
      "title": "Four operations inside check-in",
      "items": [
        "Endpoint selects tokens, declaration-items, declaration/{kind}/{identifier}, or status. These are message values, not four public server routes.",
        "The first three return JSON; accepted status reports receive an empty HTTP 200 response."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "service",
      "title": "Snapshots and errors",
      "items": [
        "Manifest retrieval refreshes the enrollment snapshot. Declaration retrieval uses the version advertised by that snapshot.",
        "Invalid endpoint syntax and invalid status data are rejected at different stages. HTTP 404 for a declaration tells the device to remove its local copy."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "transport",
      "title": "Public documentation",
